      "id": "skill-adopt",
      "name": "skill-adopt",
      "description": "Take one quarantined skill from inbox/ through scan, adjudication, a human decision, adaptation to house style, tests and promotion into skills/. Use when something is sitting in the inbox waiting on a verdict, or when a fetched skill needs auditing, adapting and adopting. Stops and asks before adopting anything. Only runs when explicitly invoked; it does not trigger on its own.",
